msgstr "允许从 WAN 访问"

msgid "Allow other peers in the network to route their Internet traffic through this node (Corresponding flag: --enable-exit-node)."
msgstr "允许网络中的其他对等节点通过本节点路由外网流量 (对应参数：--enable-exit-node)。"

msgid "Allow resolving peer node domain names (such as hostname.et.net) without memorizing virtual IP addresses (Corresponding flag: --accept-dns). Automatically forwards DNS queries via dnsmasq. Note: If third-party DNS tools (e.g. MosDNS, AdGuard Home, SmartDNS) are active, ensure this domain zone is excluded from hijacking."
msgstr "允许直接通过主机名解析节点 (对应参数：--accept-dns)。自动通过 dnsmasq 转发解析请求至内置 DNS 服务器 (100.100.100.101)。注意：若启用了第三方 DNS 代理工具（如 MosDNS、AdGuard Home、SmartDNS 或分流插件），请确保将该域名区域加入直连/放行名单以防止被劫持导致解析失败。"

msgid "Automatically determine and assign a virtual IP address (Corresponding flag: -d, --dhcp)."
msgstr "自动协商并分配虚拟网卡 IP 地址 (对应参数：-d, --dhcp)。"

msgid "Automatically open and manage firewall traffic rules on WAN zone to allow incoming connections for external peers."
msgstr "自动在 WAN 防火墙区域创建并管理通信规则，放行外部节点连接本节点的入站流量。"

